Domain Entity StudentLearningObjective [591]
    deprecated "Users of this element are advised to use Grade.LearningStandardGrade instead. Expect removal of this element in a future release."
    documentation "This entity represents the competency assessed or evaluated for the student against a specific learning objective."
    domain entity LearningObjective [1763]
        documentation "The learning objective evaluated or assessed for the student."
        is part of identity
    descriptor CompetencyLevel [1760]
        documentation "The competency level assessed for the student for the referenced learning objective."
        is required
    shared string DiagnosticStatement [1761]
        documentation "A statement provided by the teacher that provides information in addition to the grade or assessment score."
        is optional
    domain entity GradingPeriod [1762]
        documentation "Relates the LearningObjective to a grading period."
        is part of identity
        role name GradingPeriod
    domain entity Student [1765]
        documentation "Relates the student associated with the learning objective."
        is part of identity
    choice StudentLearningObjectiveSectionOrProgramChoice [2512]
        documentation "Relates the student and the section or program with the learning objective."
        is optional
        merge StudentLearningObjectiveSectionOrProgramChoice.StudentSectionAssociation.Student with Student
        merge StudentLearningObjectiveSectionOrProgramChoice.GeneralStudentProgramAssociation.Student with Student
